    kind: work_item  # 8f9a
    title: "Lazy Django QuerySet combinators (filter/exclude/all/order_by/select_related/prefetch_related/values/values_list/distinct/annotate) mint untrusted_input from db_read though they read nothing: 28 of 40 situations Phase 6 PR 1 added are this shape; ADR-0049 ruling 3's licence is now met -- move them to a disclosure boundary"  # 8f9a
    status: todo_hard  # 8f9a
    priority: 2  # 8f9a
    parent:  # 8f9a
