  nonce: '0757'  # 0757
  message: "DONE in PR #820 (commits c9fb84b704 + db4a5babe0). Measurement 0014 (docs/measurements/0014-lazy-queryset-disclosure-delta.md), pre-registered above before the run.\n\nWHAT SHIPPED. Both halves of ADR-0049 ruling 3 in one change: (1) py.py emits the QuerySet EVALUATION as a call site -- django.db.models.__iter__ at for / async for (__aiter__) / comprehension / list|tuple|set|frozenset|sorted|dict|enumerate, __getitem__ at an index subscript, a slice propagating the type -- rowed under db_read; (2) db_compose, the database twin of net_listen (deferred_crossing; absent from AUTO_SOURCE_LABEL_MAP; db_compose_edges, schema 2.3; shadows db_read), and the overlay's 21 QuerySet combinators moved to it, pinned equal to the signature table's QuerySet-returning members.\n\nTWO PREMISES OF THIS ITEM WERE WRONG ON THE TREE and are corrected here rather than followed: the Django rows live in the python-web-and-orm overlay, not python.yaml; and there is no SQLAlchemy row and no Ecto row anywhere, so the parity it asked for is moot -- the real parity population (0009's other LAZY rows) is filed separately. Route (a) was taken, with a different name: db_query is already the database_query linker's call_kind and means a call that EXECUTES a query.\n\nPOSITIVE CONTROL (P1) HELD: 0013's 27 lazy-only situations vanished, its 13 with an executing read stayed (the record's 28/12 counted one situation carrying both). P2: of 62 lazy-only baseline situations, 44 vanished and 18 survived, every survivor on __iter__ at a verified line. P3: kserve 0 moved, no verdict moved anywhere. P4: 0 new situations. READ-BACK of all 44 vanished: 33 vacuous write-receiver (the class this item exists to remove), 11 handed out of the composing scope (run_sync, a form field, a template context, an Exists() subquery, render_pdf -- disclosed by the shadow, NOT adjudicated for truth, stated as the cost), 0 in-scope reads deleted. The ship rule did not fire.\n\nINV-buzab three-row check: in test_deferred_crossing_boundary.py::TestTheDatabaseThreeRowTable, on a VOUCHED copy of the overlay -- community rows are unvouched under ADR-0047 and never license an all-clear, so on the shipped tree a Django program's boundary claims are inconclusive before clause 3 is consulted (pinned as its own test).\n\nResiduals filed: the parity sweep over 0009's other LAZY rows (after the arc); the evaluation shapes not represented (__len__/__bool__, yield from, a QuerySet handed to another scope) with 0014's D-class count as the re-open trigger; INV-mumov's candidate 2 (reverse-relation managers + custom manager names such as pretix's Model.all) as its own arc item. Carries awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # 0757
